# Mt. Moon (FireRed's MUS_MT_MOON, which Rock Tunnel and Victory Road share): a slow, echoing walk in A minor, a
# glassy lead over a low pedal and a dripping counter-line. A cave plays the same by day and night. Original
# composition for this game (plan 19 · K4).
